"ohne das Add-on gibt es nichts zu importieren."
msgstr[1] ""
"Alle %d Feeds zeigen Einträge nur an (sie legen keine Beiträge an). Füge das "
"kostenlose Add-on WPeMatico RSS Feed Reader hinzu, um sie zu importieren — "
"ohne das Add-on gibt es nichts zu importieren."

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:308
msgid ""
"%d of these feeds only displays items (it does not create posts). To import "
"it you need the free WPeMatico RSS Feed Reader addon."
msgid_plural ""
"%d of these feeds only display items (they do not create posts). To import "
"them you need the free WPeMatico RSS Feed Reader addon."
msgstr[0] ""
"%d dieser Feeds zeigt Einträge nur an (er legt keine Beiträge an). Zum "
"Importieren brauchst du das kostenlose Add-on WPeMatico RSS Feed Reader."
msgstr[1] ""
"%d dieser Feeds zeigen Einträge nur an (sie legen keine Beiträge an). Zum "
"Importieren brauchst du das kostenlose Add-on WPeMatico RSS Feed Reader."

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:324
msgid "Activate RSS Feed Reader"
msgstr "RSS Feed Reader aktivieren"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:325
msgid "Install &amp; activate RSS Feed Reader"
msgstr "RSS Feed Reader installieren &amp; aktivieren"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:330
msgid "…or import now and skip the display-only feeds."
msgstr "… oder jetzt importieren und die reinen Anzeige-Feeds überspringen."

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:340
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Importieren"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:344
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Vorschau"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:361
msgid "Other plugin"
msgstr "Anderes Plugin"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:363
msgid ""
"No data from a supported plugin was found on this site. Set up feeds in a "
"supported plugin and its importer will show up here automatically."
msgstr ""
"Auf dieser Website wurden keine Daten eines unterstützten Plugins gefunden. "
"Richte Feeds in einem unterstützten Plugin ein, und sein Importer erscheint "
"hier automatisch."

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:365
msgid ""
"Missing a plugin you want to migrate from? Let us know and we may add it."
msgstr ""
"Fehlt ein Plugin, aus dem du migrieren möchtest? Sag uns Bescheid, "
"vielleicht nehmen wir es auf."

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:369
msgid "Request integration"
msgstr "Integration anfragen"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:383
msgid "Migration in progress"
msgstr "Migration läuft"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:389
msgid "Preparing migration…"
msgstr "Migration wird vorbereitet …"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:394
#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:430
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Schließen"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:396
msgid "View campaigns"
msgstr "Kampagnen ansehen"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:406
msgid "Migration preview"
msgstr "Migrationsvorschau"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:412
msgid "Loading preview…"
msgstr "Vorschau wird geladen …"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:420
msgid "Feed URL(s)"
msgstr "Feed-URL(s)"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:431
msgid "Start migration"
msgstr "Migration starten"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:59
msgid "Import campaigns &amp; feeds"
msgstr "Kampagnen &amp; Feeds importieren"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:62
msgid ""
"Campaigns that create posts are imported deactivated, whether or not the "
"feed was running."
msgstr ""
"Kampagnen, die Beiträge anlegen, werden deaktiviert importiert — unabhängig "
"davon, ob der Feed lief."

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:68
msgid "the source plugin"
msgstr "das Quell-Plugin"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:73
msgid "Keep the feeds of a group together in one campaign"
msgstr "Die Feeds einer Gruppe in einer Kampagne zusammenhalten"

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:78
msgid ""
"A group is imported through the %s import job that uses it, never on its "
"own. Unchecked, each feed of the group becomes its own campaign."
msgstr ""
"Eine Gruppe wird über den Importauftrag von %s importiert, der sie nutzt, "
"nie für sich allein. Ohne Häkchen wird jeder Feed der Gruppe zu einer "
"eigenen Kampagne."

#: includes/migration/views/migration-box.php:96
msgid "Requires %s"
msgstr "Benötigt %s"

#: includes/module/actions.php:137
msgid "Feed to Post"
msgstr "Feed zu Beitrag"

#: includes/module/actions.php:138
msgid "AutoBlogging: Automated content curation system."
msgstr "Autoblogging: automatisches System zur Inhaltskuratierung."

#: includes/module/actions.php:144
msgid "Used by default as Feed Fetcher Campaign Type."
msgstr "Wird standardmäßig als Kampagnentyp „Feed-Abruf“ verwendet."

#: includes/module/actions.php:147
msgid "Plugin Importers"
msgstr "Plugin-Importer"

#: includes/module/actions.php:148
msgid ""
"Bring the feeds and settings of another RSS importing plugin into WPeMatico."
msgstr ""
"Hol die Feeds und Einstellungen eines anderen RSS-Import-Plugins nach "
"WPeMatico."

#: includes/module/actions.php:155
msgid "bbPress"
msgstr "bbPress"

#: includes/module/actions.php:156
msgid "Publish the curated content as forum topics, or as replies to them."
msgstr ""
"Veröffentliche die kuratierten Inhalte als Forenthemen oder als Antworten "
"darauf."

#: includes/module/actions.php:162 includes/module/actions.php:201
msgid "Enable it in a campaign by choosing its Campaign Type."
msgstr "Aktiviere es in einer Kampagne über ihren Kampagnentyp."

#: includes/module/actions.php:165
msgid "Video Campaigns"
msgstr "Videokampagnen"

#: includes/module/actions.php:166
msgid "Create campaigns that publish video content."
msgstr "Lege Kampagnen an, die Videoinhalte veröffentlichen."

#: includes/module/actions.php:170
msgid ""
"Downloads the video and audio files of each item into the WordPress uploads "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"Lädt die Video- und Audiodateien jedes Eintrags in den WordPress-Upload-"
"Ordner."

#: includes/module/actions.php:175
msgid "Feeds XML"
msgstr "Feeds XML"

#: includes/module/actions.php:176
msgid "Import content from XML feeds with custom structures."
msgstr "Importiere Inhalte aus XML-Feeds mit eigener Struktur."

#: includes/module/actions.php:181
msgid "Adds the XML file type to the ones WordPress accepts on upload."
msgstr ""
"Fügt den Dateityp XML zu denen hinzu, die WordPress beim Upload akzeptiert."

#: includes/module/actions.php:186
msgid "Publish the videos of a Vimeo user, channel or group."
msgstr ""
"Veröffentliche die Videos eines Vimeo-Benutzers, -Kanals oder einer -Gruppe."

#: includes/module/actions.php:190
msgid ""
"Adds Vimeo to the Campaign Type list. Paste the address of the profile, "
"channel or group and the campaign finds its feed on its own."
msgstr ""
"Fügt Vimeo zur Liste der Kampagnentypen hinzu. Füge die Adresse des Profils, "
"Kanals oder der Gruppe ein, und die Kampagne findet den Feed von selbst."

#: includes/module/actions.php:195
msgid "Import videos from YouTube channels."
msgstr "Importiere Videos aus YouTube-Kanälen."

#: includes/module/actions.php:205
msgid ""
"Assign categories automatically from the words found in the curated content."
msgstr ""
"Weise Kategorien automatisch anhand der Wörter im kuratierten Inhalt zu."

#: includes/module/actions.php:209
msgid "Set the words and the category each one maps to in the Settings page."
msgstr ""
"Lege die Wörter und die jeweils zugeordnete Kategorie auf der "
"Einstellungsseite fest."

#: includes/module/actions.php:213
msgid "Canonical URLs"
msgstr "Canonical URLs"

#: includes/module/actions.php:214
msgid ""
"Credit the original article with a canonical URL on every imported post."
msgstr ""
"Nenne den Originalartikel mit einer Canonical URL in jedem importierten "
"Beitrag."

#: includes/module/actions.php:218
msgid ""
"Tells search engines which is the original article, so the copy is not "
"judged as duplicate content."
msgstr ""
"Sagt Suchmaschinen, welches der Originalartikel ist, damit die Kopie nicht "
"als doppelter Inhalt gewertet wird."

#: includes/module/actions.php:222
msgid "Download Images"
msgstr "Bilder herunterladen"

#: includes/module/actions.php:223
msgid "Download the images of each item into the WordPress Media Library."
msgstr "Lade die Bilder jedes Eintrags in die WordPress-Mediathek."

#: includes/module/actions.php:228
msgid ""
"Turn it on here; the size, quality and naming options are in the Settings "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Hier einschalten; Größe, Qualität und Benennung stehen auf der "
"Einstellungsseite."

#: includes/module/actions.php:231
msgid "Featured Images"
msgstr "Beitragsbilder"

#: includes/module/actions.php:232
msgid ""
"Give every imported post a featured image, taken from the first image of the "
"item."
msgstr ""
"Gib jedem importierten Beitrag ein Beitragsbild, genommen aus dem ersten "
"Bild des Eintrags."

#: includes/module/actions.php:237
msgid ""
"Each campaign can override it, and the Featured Image from URL module "
"decides whether the image is downloaded or linked."
msgstr ""
"Jede Kampagne kann das überschreiben, und das Modul „Beitragsbild von einer "
"URL“ entscheidet, ob das Bild heruntergeladen oder verlinkt wird."

#: includes/module/actions.php:241
msgid "Email Notifications"
msgstr "E-Mail-Benachrichtigungen"

#: includes/module/actions.php:242
msgid "Get an email report every time a campaign finishes a run."
msgstr ""
"Erhalte jedes Mal einen E-Mail-Bericht, wenn eine Kampagne einen Lauf "
"beendet."

#: includes/module/actions.php:248
msgid "Deactivate in each campaign by clearing the email field."
msgstr "In jeder Kampagne abschalten, indem du das E-Mail-Feld leerst."

#: includes/module/actions.php:251
msgid "Random Galleries"
msgstr "Zufällige Galerien"

#: includes/module/actions.php:252
msgid ""
"Group images by topic and give each post a featured image picked at random "
"from its gallery."
msgstr ""
"Gruppiere Bilder nach Thema und gib jedem Beitrag ein zufällig aus seiner "
"Galerie gewähltes Beitragsbild."

#: includes/module/actions.php:258 includes/module/actions.php:269
#: includes/module/actions.php:652 includes/module/actions.php:664
#: includes/module/actions.php:687
msgid "Available in the Professional addon."
msgstr "Im Add-on Professional verfügbar."

#: includes/module/actions.php:261
msgid "Random Rewrites"
msgstr "Zufällige Umschreibungen"

#: includes/module/actions.php:262
msgid "Rewrite custom words randomly as synonyms."
msgstr "Schreibe bestimmte Wörter zufällig als Synonyme um."

#: includes/module/actions.php:266
msgid ""
"You must complete the words separated by comma and per line in the textarea."
msgstr ""
"Du musst die Wörter im Textfeld pro Zeile und durch Kommas getrennt "
"eintragen."

#: includes/module/actions.php:310
msgid "Turning this off deactivates the %s plugin."
msgstr "Wenn du das abschaltest, wird das Plugin %s deaktiviert."

#: includes/module/actions.php:312
msgid "The plugin is installed but not running. Turning this on activates %s."
msgstr ""
"Das Plugin ist installiert, läuft aber nicht. Wenn du das einschaltest, wird "
"%s aktiviert."

#: includes/module/actions.php:318
msgid ""
"%s is not installed yet. Install it from here, free, and this switch turns "
"it on."
msgstr ""
"%s ist noch nicht installiert. Installiere es kostenlos von hier aus, und "
"dieser Schalter aktiviert es."

#: includes/module/actions.php:322
msgid "Needs the %s addon. Get it at etruel.com and this switch enables it."
msgstr ""
"Benötigt das Add-on %s. Hol es dir auf etruel.com, dann aktiviert dieser "
"Schalter es."

#: includes/module/actions.php:361 includes/module/actions.php:435
msgid ""
"%s is installed but not active. Turn it on and this module becomes available."
msgstr ""
"%s ist installiert, aber nicht aktiv. Schalte es ein, dann steht dieses "
"Modul zur Verfügung."

#: includes/module/actions.php:420
msgid "It also needs the free %s plugin."
msgstr "Es braucht außerdem das kostenlose Plugin %s."

#: includes/module/actions.php:440
msgid "Needs the free %s plugin, which is not installed yet."
msgstr "Benötigt das kostenlose Plugin %s, das noch nicht installiert ist."

#: includes/module/actions.php:441 includes/module/dashboard.php:62
#: includes/module/manager.php:194
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Installieren"

#: includes/module/actions.php:516
msgid "Delete Duplicates"
msgstr "Duplikate löschen"

#: includes/module/actions.php:517
msgid "Automatically search and delete duplicated posts by name or content."
msgstr "Suche und lösche doppelte Beiträge automatisch nach Name oder Inhalt."

#: includes/module/actions.php:522
msgid "Installs the free WP Delete Post Copies plugin from WordPress.org."
msgstr ""
"Installiert das kostenlose Plugin WP Delete Post Copies von WordPress.org."

#: includes/module/actions.php:526
msgid "WPeMatico Polylang"
msgstr "WPeMatico Polylang"

#: includes/module/actions.php:527
msgid ""
"Assigns the imported posts to the right language on sites running Polylang."
msgstr ""
"Ordnet die importierten Beiträge auf Websites mit Polylang der richtigen "
"Sprache zu."

#: includes/module/actions.php:532
msgid "Installs the free WPeMatico Polylang plugin from WordPress.org."
msgstr ""
"Installiert das kostenlose Plugin WPeMatico Polylang von WordPress.org."

#: includes/module/actions.php:539
msgid ""
"The addon files each imported post under a language, and languages only "
"exist while Polylang runs."
msgstr ""
"Das Add-on ordnet jeden importierten Beitrag einer Sprache zu, und Sprachen "
"gibt es nur, solange Polylang läuft."

#: includes/module/actions.php:544
msgid "RSS Items Aggregator"
msgstr "RSS-Eintragssammler"

#: includes/module/actions.php:545
msgid ""
"Also known as RSS Feed Reader: shows the items of several feeds inside one "
"post or page."
msgstr ""
"Auch bekannt als RSS Feed Reader: zeigt die Einträge mehrerer Feeds in einem "
"Beitrag oder einer Seite."

#: includes/module/actions.php:550
msgid "Installs the free WPeMatico RSS Feed Reader plugin from WordPress.org."
msgstr ""
"Installiert das kostenlose Plugin WPeMatico RSS Feed Reader von "
"WordPress.org."

#: includes/module/actions.php:551
msgid "Requires WPeMatico RSS Feed Reader"
msgstr "Benötigt WPeMatico RSS Feed Reader"

#: includes/module/actions.php:561
msgid ""
"Use the image at its original URL as featured image, without downloading it."
msgstr ""
"Das Bild unter seiner ursprünglichen URL als Beitragsbild verwenden, ohne es "
"herunterzuladen."

#: includes/module/actions.php:568
msgid ""
"Featured Images is off, so nothing picks the image to link — unless an addon "
"such as Professional or Full Content supplies one."
msgstr ""
"Beitragsbilder ist aus, es wählt also nichts das zu verlinkende Bild aus — "
"es sei denn, ein Add-on wie Professional oder Full Content liefert eines."

#: includes/module/actions.php:569
msgid ""
"The image is linked from its original site instead of being downloaded, so "
"it takes up no space in your Media Library."
msgstr ""
"Das Bild wird von seiner ursprünglichen Website verlinkt statt "
"heruntergeladen und belegt daher keinen Platz in deiner Mediathek."

#: includes/module/actions.php:578
msgid ""
"WPeMatico stores the image URL on each post; that plugin is what turns it "
"into the featured image WordPress shows."
msgstr ""
"WPeMatico speichert die Bild-URL an jedem Beitrag; erst jenes Plugin macht "
"daraus das Beitragsbild, das WordPress anzeigt."

#: includes/module/actions.php:589
msgid "Auto Delete"
msgstr "Automatisch löschen"

#: includes/module/actions.php:590
msgid ""
"Delete the posts of the categories you choose once they reach a given age."
msgstr ""
"Lösche die Beiträge der von dir gewählten Kategorien, sobald sie ein "
"bestimmtes Alter erreichen."

#: includes/module/actions.php:596
msgid "Helpful if you want to remove stale or old items automatically."
msgstr ""
"Praktisch, wenn veraltete oder alte Einträge automatisch verschwinden sollen."

#: includes/module/actions.php:604
msgid ""
"The addon extends that free plugin, the same one the Delete Duplicates card "
"installs."
msgstr ""
"Das Add-on erweitert jenes kostenlose Plugin — dasselbe, das die Karte "
"„Duplikate löschen“ installiert."

#: includes/module/actions.php:609
msgid "Polyglot"
msgstr "Polyglot"

#: includes/module/actions.php:610
msgid ""
"Translate the fetched content with any of several free and paid translation "
"engines."
msgstr ""
"Übersetze die geholten Inhalte mit einer von mehreren kostenlosen und "
"kostenpflichtigen Übersetzungs-Engines."

#: includes/module/actions.php:617
msgid "Requires WPeMatico Polyglot addon"
msgstr "Benötigt das Add-on WPeMatico Polyglot"

#: includes/module/actions.php:621
msgid "GPT Spinner AI"
msgstr "GPT Spinner AI"

#: includes/module/actions.php:622
msgid "Rewrite the fetched content automatically through an AI or spinner API."
msgstr ""
"Schreibe die geholten Inhalte automatisch über eine KI- oder Spinner-API um."

#: includes/module/actions.php:629
msgid "Requires AI addon"
msgstr "Benötigt das KI-Add-on"

#: includes/module/actions.php:633
msgid "Full Contents"
msgstr "Vollständige Inhalte"

#: includes/module/actions.php:634
msgid "Enable full content extraction from each source website."
msgstr ""
"Aktiviere die Extraktion des vollständigen Inhalts von jeder Quellwebsite."

#: includes/module/actions.php:641
msgid "Requires WPeMatico Full Content addon"
msgstr "Benötigt das Add-on WPeMatico Full Content"

#: includes/module/actions.php:645
msgid "Bulk Add Sources"
msgstr "Quellen im Block hinzufügen"

#: includes/module/actions.php:646
msgid ""
"Paste or upload a list of feeds to add many sources to a campaign at once."
msgstr ""
"Füge eine Liste von Feeds ein oder lade sie hoch, um einer Kampagne viele "
"Quellen auf einmal hinzuzufügen."

#: includes/module/actions.php:653
msgid "A Professional feature, you can activate it here."
msgstr "Eine Professional-Funktion, die du hier aktivieren kannst."

#: includes/module/actions.php:657
msgid "Keyword Filtering"
msgstr "Stichwortfilterung"

#: includes/module/actions.php:658
msgid ""
"Keep or skip each item by the keywords found in its title or its content."
msgstr ""
"Behalte oder überspringe jeden Eintrag anhand der Stichwörter in seinem "
"Titel oder Inhalt."

#: includes/module/actions.php:668
msgid "Facebook Source"
msgstr "Facebook als Quelle"

#: includes/module/actions.php:669
msgid "Import content from Facebook profiles and groups."
msgstr "Importiere Inhalte aus Facebook-Profilen und -Gruppen."

#: includes/module/actions.php:676
msgid "Requires Facebook Campaign addon"
msgstr "Benötigt das Add-on Facebook Campaign"

#: includes/module/actions.php:680
msgid "Export/Import Campaigns"
msgstr "Kampagnen exportieren/importieren"

#: includes/module/actions.php:681
msgid "Migrate campaigns between sites."
msgstr "Übertrage Kampagnen zwischen Websites."

#: includes/module/actions.php:691
msgid "Feed Creator"
msgstr "Feed Creator"

#: includes/module/actions.php:692
msgid ""
"Generate custom RSS feeds from external webpages to fetch with WPeMatico."
msgstr ""
"Erzeuge eigene RSS-Feeds aus externen Webseiten, die WPeMatico dann abruft."

#: includes/module/actions.php:699
msgid "Requires \"Make Me Feed\" addon"
msgstr "Benötigt das Add-on „Make Me Feed“"

#: includes/module/actions.php:703
msgid "Publish To Email"
msgstr "Per E-Mail veröffentlichen"

#: includes/module/actions.php:704
msgid ""
"Mail each post of a campaign to an address that publishes it, instead of "
"publishing it here or as well as here."
msgstr ""
"Schicke jeden Beitrag einer Kampagne an eine Adresse, die ihn veröffentlicht "
"— statt hier zu veröffentlichen oder zusätzlich dazu."

#: includes/module/actions.php:711
msgid "Requires Email Campaign addon"
msgstr "Benötigt das Add-on Email Campaign"

#: includes/module/actions.php:715
msgid "Better Excerpts"
msgstr "Bessere Textauszüge"

#: includes/module/actions.php:716
msgid ""
"Cut the excerpt at the length you set and back to the end of the last whole "
"sentence, never mid-word."
msgstr ""
"Kürze den Auszug auf die von dir gesetzte Länge und zurück bis zum Ende des "
"letzten ganzen Satzes, nie mitten im Wort."

#: includes/module/actions.php:723
msgid "Requires Better Excerpts addon"
msgstr "Benötigt das Add-on Better Excerpts"

#: includes/module/actions.php:727
msgid "Synchronizer"
msgstr "Synchronizer"

#: includes/module/actions.php:728
msgid ""
"Update the posts you already imported when the source article changes, "
"instead of publishing a duplicate."
msgstr ""
"Aktualisiere bereits importierte Beiträge, wenn sich der Quellartikel "
"ändert, statt ein Duplikat zu veröffentlichen."

#: includes/module/actions.php:735
msgid "Requires Synchronizer addon"
msgstr "Benötigt das Add-on Synchronizer"

#: includes/module/actions.php:739
msgid "Manual Fetching"
msgstr "Manueller Abruf"

#: includes/module/actions.php:740
msgid ""
"See the items each feed will bring, and publish the ones you choose one by "
"one or in bulk."
msgstr ""
"Sieh, welche Einträge jeder Feed bringt, und veröffentliche die ausgewählten "
"einzeln oder im Block."

#: includes/module/actions.php:747
msgid "Requires Manual Fetching addon"
msgstr "Benötigt das Add-on Manual Fetching"

#: includes/module/actions.php:751
msgid "Exporter"
msgstr "Exporter"

#: includes/module/actions.php:752
msgid ""
"Export your posts to a file on a schedule, in the format your template "
"defines, by download, folder, FTP or SSH."
msgstr ""
"Exportiere deine Beiträge planmäßig in eine Datei, im Format deiner Vorlage, "
"per Download, Ordner, FTP oder SSH."

#: includes/module/actions.php:759
msgid "Requires Exporter addon"
msgstr "Benötigt das Add-on Exporter"

#: includes/module/actions.php:763
msgid "Office"
msgstr "Office"

#: includes/module/actions.php:764
msgid ""
"Publish posts from the .docx and PDF files in a folder of your server, with "
"their text and their images."
msgstr ""
"Veröffentliche Beiträge aus den .docx- und PDF-Dateien eines Ordners auf "
"deinem Server, mit Text und Bildern."

#: includes/module/actions.php:771
msgid "Requires Office Campaign addon"
msgstr "Benötigt das Add-on Office Campaign"

#: includes/module/actions.php:779
msgid "Rewrite Rules"
msgstr "Umschreiberegeln"

#: includes/module/actions.php:780
msgid "Search and replace words or HTML in the fetched content, per campaign."
msgstr "Suche und ersetze Wörter oder HTML im geholten Inhalt, pro Kampagne."

#: includes/module/actions.php:787
msgid "Customer Support"
msgstr "Kundenbetreuung"

#: includes/module/actions.php:788
msgid ""
"Free setup assistance and troubleshooting, or step up to Premium Support."
msgstr ""
"Kostenlose Hilfe beim Einrichten und bei Problemen — oder wechsle zum "
"Premium-Support."

#: includes/module/actions.php:796
msgid "Requires registration at etruel.com"
